at_9kmh":4,"box_km":[2.99,3.01],"arrival_m":2061},"edits":["A bench up to 24 m wide is cut along the jeep track to the smoothed track profile (the 30 m DSM includes tree canopy).","Road bumps and ruts in the drive are illustrative; the grade and the line of the track are real.","Trees, shrubs, grass tufts and boulders are placed where WorldCover maps that cover; their size and number are illustrative.","The walking loop is a 150 m circle around the arrival point; it is not a mapped trail.","The mosque is the Atlas TRELLIS model made from one CC BY-SA Commons photo (Asfandyarlahor, Thall_Mosque_Dir_Kumrat.jpg); it is not a survey.","The model's size, 25 x 23 x 24 m, is estimated from that photo, not measured; OSM maps no footprint for the mosque.","The ground within 30 m of the mosque is levelled to its base; the rest of the village is the DEM slope, and its houses are not mapped in OSM so they are not drawn.","Season colours, snow, ice and dawn mist are illustrative.","Traffic on the drive is illustrative: the vehicle kinds are those seen on Swat roads (Willys jeeps, Hilux, Suzuki vans, Mehran cars, CD70 motorbikes, Qingqi rickshaws, painted trucks); their number and movement are not counted."],"sources":[{"name":"Copernicus DEM GLO-30","use":"terrain heights","licence":"© DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA","url":"https://spacedata.copernicus.eu/collections/copernicus-digital-elevation-model"},{"name":"ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200","use":"trees, meadow, rock, snow","licence":"CC BY 4.0, © ESA WorldCover project 2021","url":"https://esa-worldcover.org"},{"name":"Jamia Masjid Thal model (TRELLIS, MIT; photo CC BY-SA 4.0)","use":"the mosque, generated from one Commons photo by Asfandyarlahor","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0 (photo, share-alike applies to the derived model); TRELLIS code MIT","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Thall_Mosque_Dir_Kumrat.jpg"},{"name":"OpenStreetMap","use":"the S-16 road from the south-west to the bridge at the mosque; the Panjkora river; no building footprints mapped in Thal","licence":"ODbL, © OpenStreetMap contributors","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"}]}